<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Unicom Corp upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Unicom Corp upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley upgraded Unicom Corp to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Unicom gained 1-1/8 to 21-1/4.</p>
